<p>Build board decks that tell a story — not just show data. Every section has an owner, a narrative, and a "so what."</p>
<h2>Keywords</h2>
<p>board deck, investor update, board meeting, board pack, investor relations, quarterly review, board presentation, fundraising deck, investor deck, board narrative, QBR, quarterly business review</p>
<h2>Quick Start</h2>
<p>Ask for a board deck in natural language, naming cadence and stage:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>"Build a quarterly board deck — we're Series A."
"Draft a fundraising board deck for a seed-stage company."</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Provide available metrics. The builder fills gaps with explicit placeholders — never invents numbers.</p>
<h2>Deck Structure (Standard Order)</h2>
